# Web rules

- Use function components with named exports (no default exports).
- State uses `useState` / `useReducer` only. Do not add a state management library.
- Do not write game rules or calculations; call `@rpg/domain`, and import it from the package root only.
- Keep `src/pages/` thin. Put logic and components in `src/features/<name>/`.
- Put generic UI in `src/ui/`.
- Style with Tailwind utilities, using the color and font tokens defined in `@theme` in `src/index.css`.
- Layouts must work at 375px wide. Go mobile-first and add `sm:` and larger breakpoints on top.
- Give images `alt` text and give interactive elements accessible labels.
- User-facing text is Japanese. Component JSDoc describes what is rendered; each prop has its own JSDoc on the props type.
